   "source": [
    "# PTCG ABC — Colab 実行環境\n",
    "\n",
    "大量対戦を Colab の CPU で回す。Mac 側はコード修正と局面確認に使う。\n",
    "\n",
    "前提は `docs/design.md` の 0 節と 7 節。要点だけ再掲する。\n",
    "\n",
    "- エンジンは `libcg.so` (Linux x86_64) を同梱しているので Colab で動く。Kaggle 本番も Linux\n",
    "- 乱数シードは指定できない。再現性は対戦ログで担保する\n",
    "- GPU は使わない。CUDA を使う処理がないため、割り当てても速くならない\n",
    "- 資源は保証されないので、小分けに回して 1 戦ごとに Drive へ追記する"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 1. 環境の確認"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os, platform, subprocess\n",
    "print(platform.platform())\n",
    "print('python', platform.python_version())\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    cpu = len(os.sched_getaffinity(0))\n",
    "except AttributeError:\n",
    "    cpu = os.cpu_count()\n",
    "print('使える論理 CPU:', cpu)\n",
    "print(subprocess.run(['free','-h'], capture_output=True, text=True).stdout)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 2. インストール\n", "\n", "Mac 側と同じ 1.32.2 に固定する。エンジンの挙動が版で変わると比較にならない。"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": ["!pip -q install 'kaggle-environments==1.32.2'"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. リポジトリの取得\n",
    "\n",
    "private リポジトリなので認証が要る。Colab の「シークレット」に `GITHUB_TOKEN` を\n",
    "登録しておくと、下のセルがそれを使う。登録がなければ Drive に置いた zip を探す。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os, subprocess, glob\n",
    "REPO = 'Tomomon2525/mutsugi_team'\n",
    "BRANCH = 'tkawamura'\n",
    "WORK = '/content/ptcg-abc'\n",
    "\n",
    "token = None\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    from google.colab import userdata\n",
    "    token = userdata.get('GITHUB_TOKEN')\n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print('シークレット未設定:', e)\n",
    "\n",
    "if os.path.isdir(os.path.join(WORK, '.git')):\n",
    "    print(subprocess.run(['git','-C',WORK,'pull','--ff-only'], capture_output=True, text=True).stdout)\n",
    "elif token:\n",
    "    url = f'https://{token}@github.com/{REPO}.git'\n",
    "    r = subprocess.run(['git','clone','--depth','50','-b',BRANCH,url,WORK], capture_output=True, text=True)\n",
    "    print(r.stdout or r.stderr)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    from google.colab import drive\n",
    "    drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
    "    zips = sorted(glob.glob('/content/drive/MyDrive/**/ptcg-abc*.zip', recursive=True))\n",
    "    assert zips, 'GITHUB_TOKEN も Drive 上の zip も見つからない'\n",
    "    print('展開:', zips[-1])\n",
    "    !unzip -q -o \"{zips[-1]}\" -d /content/\n",
    "\n",
    "os.chdir(WORK)\n",
    "print(subprocess.run(['git','log','--oneline','-1'], capture_output=True, text=True).stdout)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 4. エンジンが Linux で動くかの確認"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys, os\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, '/content/ptcg-abc/shared')\n",
