   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. スループットの実測\n",
    "\n",
    "判断基準は 1 戦あたりの速度ではなく **1 時間あたりの完了対戦数**。\n",
    "論理 CPU 数を超えて並列を増やすと遅くなるので、そこも含めて測る。\n",
    "Mac (8 論理 CPU, 並列 6) の数字と比べて、どちらで回すかを決める。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%env PTCG_TIME_POOL=70\n",
    "%env PTCG_MAX_SLICE=0.58\n",
    "%env PTCG_RESERVE=5.2\n",
    "%env PTCG_MIN_SLICE=0.03\n",
    "!python tools/bench.py -j 1,2,4 -n 4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Drive を結果の保存先にする\n",
    "\n",
    "ランタイム内だけに置くと切断で消える。1 戦ごとに追記されるので、\n",
    "落ちても同じコマンドを流し直せば未完了分から再開する。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount('/content/drive', force_remount=False)\n",
    "OUT = '/content/drive/MyDrive/ptcg-abc/league'\n",
    "os.makedirs(OUT, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "print(OUT)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. 対戦を回す\n",
    "\n",
    "並列数は 5 節の結果に合わせる。`-n` は総対戦数で、途中で切れても同じ数を\n",
    "指定して流し直せばよい。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "JOBS = 2  # 5 節の最良値に合わせる\n",
    "!python tools/league.py agents/d0_grimmsnarl champions/572_6/agent \\\n",
    "    -n 200 -j {JOBS} -b 25 -o {OUT}/ctx_vs_champ.jsonl"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["### 対面別に測る場合"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "for foe in ['e_lucario', 'e_alakazam', 'e_dragapult']:\n",
    "    print('=' * 60, foe)\n",
    "    !python tools/league.py agents/d0_grimmsnarl agents/{foe} \\\n",
    "        -n 100 -j {JOBS} -b 25 -o {OUT}/d0_vs_{foe}.jsonl"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. 集計だけ見る\n",
    "\n",
    "対戦を回さずに、保存済みの結果から現在の勝率を出す。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import glob, json\n",
    "for path in sorted(glob.glob(f'{OUT}/*.jsonl')):\n",
    "    w = l = d = 0\n",
    "    for line in open(path):\n",
    "        try:\n",
    "            r = json.loads(line)\n",
    "        except Exception:\n",
    "            continue\n",
    "        if 'result' not in r:\n",
    "            continue\n",
    "        w += r['result'] > 0; l += r['result'] < 0; d += r['result'] == 0\n",
    "    n = w + l + d\n",
    "    if not n:\n",
    "        continue\n",
    "    z = (w / n - 0.5) / (0.25 / n) ** 0.5\n",
    "    print(f\"{os.path.basename(path):<32} {n:>4}戦 {w:>3}勝{l:>3}敗{d:>3}分  {w/n:>6.1%}  z={z:+.2f}\")"
   ]
  }
